  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Augmente la Défense Spéciale du porteur de 1.5x.  Empêche le porteur de sélectionner des capacités de statut.",
      "short_effect": "Augmente la Défense Spéciale du porteur de 1.5x.  Empêche le porteur de sélectionner des capacités de statut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Raises the holder’s Special Defense to 1.5×.  Prevents the holder from selecting a status move.",
      "short_effect": "Raises the holder’s Special Defense to 1.5×.  Prevents the holder from selecting a status move.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "こうげきてきに　なる　チョッキ。\nもたせると　とくぼうが　あがるが\nへんかわざを　だせなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "공격적으로 변하는 조끼.\n지니게 하면 특수방어가 올라가지만\n변화 기술을 쓸 수 없게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Objet à tenir. Une veste augmentant la Défense\nSpéciale, mais empêchant d’utiliser des attaques\nde statut.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trägt ein Pokémon diese Weste, erhöht sich\nseine Spezial-Verteidigung, aber es kann keine\nStatus-Attacken mehr einsetzen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Venusaur en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a un Pokémon.\nQuesto corpetto aumenta la Difesa Speciale\nma impedisce l’uso di mosse di stato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon.\nThis offensive vest raises Sp. Def\nbut prevents the use of status moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攻撃的に　なる　チョッキ。\n持たせると　特防が　あがるが\n変化技を　だせなくなる。",
